  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.106 - AM006 respects C#-exact destination member casing\n - ConstructUsing initializer ownership now uses ordinal case-sensitive comparison\n - Case-distinct properties such as Value and value are analyzed independently\n - Existing same-cased construction and conversion ownership remain unchanged\n - No rule ID or severity changes",
